msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.floordiv:8 of
msgid "LHS tile."
msgstr "左操作数（LHS）Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.floordiv:10 of
msgid "RHS tile."
msgstr "右操作数（RHS）Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.floordiv:13 of
msgid ""
"The ``shape`` of ``x`` and ``y`` will be broadcasted and ``dtype`` "
"promoted to common dtype."
msgstr "``x`` 和 ``y`` 的 ``shape`` 将会进行广播，且 ``dtype`` 会提升为公共数据类型（common dtype）。"

